---
title: Non-Alcoholic Sangria
nutrition:
  calories: 138 cal
  fat: 0.4 g
  saturated fat: 0.1 g
  carbohydrates: 35.1 g
  sugar: 31.1 g
  protein: 0.7 g
  fiber: 1.9 g
  sodium: 23.6 mg
  serving size: Serves 8
course: Beverage, Cocktail, Sangria
tags: cocktails, drinks, fruit
time required: 5 min
servings: 8
author: Emily Han
source: https://www.thekitchn.com/recipe-non-alcoholic-sangria-170254
---

Pour @water{2%cups}(boiling) over @black tea bags{2} and @cinnamon sticks{2} and steep for ~{5%minutes}.
Discard tea bags and stir in @sugar{1/2%cups} to dissolve.

In a large #jar{} or #pitcher{}, combine the tea, cinnamon sticks, @pomegranate juice{3%cups},
@orange juice{1%cups}, @orange{1}(sliced into thin rounds), @lemon{1}(sliced into thin rounds),
@lime{1}(sliced into thin rounds), and @apple{1}(cored and cut into 1/2-inch chunks).
Refrigerate for at least ~{1%hour} and preferably overnight.

Just before serving, stir in @cold sparkling water or club soda{3%cups}.
Serve in glasses over ice.
